{"unit_id":"suntham-t__super-cu#card-zh","repo":"suntham-t/super-cu","commit":"3dbf70de08915b69436612ad15509fc113884581","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-super-cu 是面向 Windows 桌面客户端的 DSH 插件：通过两个 MCP 工具连接 UI Automation，读取窗口控件并执行界面操作。cu_show 可列出桌面窗口、查看控件和文本、筛选元素，并按需返回带标记的截图；cu_do 可批量点击、输入、选择、切换控件、操作窗口，并等待或断言界面状态。工具可复用快照中的元素 ID，支持后台可执行的 UI Automation 控件动作。适合需要让 DSH 操作 Windows 应用的用户。需要 Windows 10/11、Python 3.11+、Pillow 与 uiautomation。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/server.py:488-522","src/server.py:524-550","src/server.py:1145-1220","src/server.py:1222-1240","src/bridge.py:1893-1920","src/compact.py:1-80"]}
{"unit_id":"suntham-t__super-cu#card-en","repo":"suntham-t/super-cu","commit":"3dbf70de08915b69436612ad15509fc113884581","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-super-cu lets DSH inspect and control Windows apps through UI Automation. cu_show lists windows and reads controls or text, with optional screenshots. cu_do batches input, control and window actions, waits, and assertions. Requires Windows 10/11, Python 3.11+, Pillow, and uiautomation.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/server.py:488-522","src/server.py:524-550","src/server.py:1145-1220","src/server.py:1222-1240","src/bridge.py:1893-1920","src/compact.py:1-80"]}
